cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "AV Sensor-Integrity Monitor (simulation)"
abstract: >-
  An open, simulation-only study of sensor-fusion integrity for an automated
  vehicle: fusing GPS, IMU, and wheel-speed with an Extended Kalman Filter, and
  detecting when a sensor cannot be trusted. Milestones M0–M1 deliver the
  sensor-fusion foundation and the first integrity check (a normalized-innovation
  consistency test that flags and gates an untrustworthy reading).
